# twin: render_one
# One console that draws the two-part picture in OpenGL and leaves its
# context with an error nobody read and with pixel-pack state of rows
# longer than the picture, a start past its first pixel and an alignment
# of 8: the harness reads each frame back by none of it, takes the error
# for none of its own, and puts the pixel-pack state back.
console 0 core=test render=gl
option 0 link_test_render gl
option 0 link_test_gl_state dirty
30 checkpoint early
60 save mid
60 checkpoint mid
120 end
